Subject: winedmo: reset read-ahead on repeated absolute seeks
License: LGPL-2.1-or-later

An absolute seek to the previous target must reset the demuxer and queues.
Serialize demux reads with seeks, allow file reads during positioning, and
flush downstream before waiting for locks held across Receive. Use the
requesting pin's target and rewind zero targets when restarting after Stop.

--- a/dlls/winedmo/winedmo_quartz_parser.c
+++ b/dlls/winedmo/winedmo_quartz_parser.c
@@ -221,12 +221,15 @@
     BOOL read_flushing;
